{"at": "2026-11-04T00:20:59.883Z", "run": "20261103-1637-expand-netdisk-pan-9a0e", "unit": "u05", "op": "set", "rid": "netdisk-pan/1yunpan", "path": "$.identity_cost.detail", "old": "an email address and an emailed six-digit code; the register form has username, password, confirm, email, email_code and an agreement checkbox with no phone or mobile input present", "new": "an email address at one of a fixed list of domains (including gmail.com, qq.com, icloud.com, 163.com and yahoo.com) and an emailed six-digit code; the register form has username, password, confirm, email, email_code and an agreement checkbox with no phone or mobile input present", "rung": "measured", "evidence": {"url": "probe:https://www.1yunpan.com/config.json", "date": "2026-11-03", "proved": "the config disables registration with any email domain and carries an email_whitelist of permitted domains", "capture": "sha256:6ce2e8085f6efcb6680948e05ef4cd11edc846997f85dc9948a0f5210d19570d", "quote": "\"allow_all_email_to_register\": 0,"}, "added": true, "reason": "the registration config restricts the email domain to a whitelist"}
{"at": "2026-11-04T00:20:59.904Z", "run": "20261103-1637-expand-netdisk-pan-9a0e", "unit": "u05", "op": "set", "rid": "netdisk-pan/1yunpan", "path": "$.reliability_note", "old": "Reads are real: a 1,326,142,372-byte MP4 came back byte-exact against Content-Length with Range honoured, and a ranged GET returned 206 with a correct Content-Range. The 400 GB is streak-gated, so an account that stops logging in loses headroom", "new": "Reads are real: a 1,326,142,372-byte MP4 came back byte-exact against Content-Length with Range honoured, and a ranged GET returned 206 with a correct Content-Range. The site notice states that files uploaded between 2026-10-05_22:00:00 and 2026-10-30_23:59:59 are temporarily not downloadable and that file upload is temporarily stopped, and config.json sets upload.temporarily_disabled to true. The 400 GB is streak-gated, so an account that stops logging in loses headroom", "rung": "documented", "evidence": {"url": "https://www.1yunpan.com/", "date": "2026-11-03", "proved": "the front page carries a notice that files uploaded in a stated window are temporarily not downloadable, older files are unaffected, and file upload is temporarily stopped", "capture": "sha256:ba040c4c5957d054c511d27c79634b26062899734df270bc6760b45649a73604", "quote": "技术故障导致 2026-10-05_22:00:00 至 2026-10-30_23:59:59 期间上传的文件暂时无法下载，技术人员正在维护系统并从冷备份中恢复，我们会尽快恢复文件的正常下载。对于 2026-10-05:20:00:00 以前上传的文件均可正常下载未受影响。系统目前暂时停止文件上传功能。"}, "added": true, "reason": "the front page now carries an outage notice that the record lacked"}
